ol is complete and coherent: healthy pre-restart state, acknowledgement, changed boot identity, and recovered package/service state were observed; the lifecycle boot identities independently agree.","limitations":["No real full-system update was applied; behavior was demonstrated using DNF transaction previews. This is strong and appropriately bounded evidence, but slightly less conclusive than observing an actual update complete.","The final full-upgrade preview returned code 1 because --assumeno declined the proposed transaction; its captured plan still directly reported 211 upgrades and zero curl rows.","A small temporary preview file remained under /tmp after verification."]}
